{"unit_id":"TecFancy__dsh-mobile#card-zh","repo":"TecFancy/dsh-mobile","commit":"505704abddb4fdb26efafe3e92160c956d664ee9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile 是面向 DSH Web 的移动端适配插件，通过 DSH 客户端插件接入窄屏布局，并依赖 layout 服务同步侧栏和详情面板状态。它在 768 像素以下将展开的侧栏改为覆盖式抽屉并提供遮罩，避免挤压会话内容；将详情面板作为右侧浮层；调整输入栏模型选择器和按钮的窄屏排布，扩大触控区域；把设置对话框改为纵向布局和横向滚动标签，并在用户操作前避免手机输入框自动弹出键盘。样式只针对窄屏生效，适合在手机浏览器上使用 DSH Web。安装到 Web profile 后重启 DSH Web；不需要额外 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:32-93","src/client/shell.css.ts:43-239","package.json:43-52"]}
{"unit_id":"TecFancy__dsh-mobile#card-en","repo":"TecFancy/dsh-mobile","commit":"505704abddb4fdb26efafe3e92160c956d664ee9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile adapts DSH Web for phones. Below 768 pixels it overlays the sidebar and details panel, adjusts the composer and settings dialog, enlarges touch targets, and delays automatic composer focus until interaction. Install it in a Web profile; no API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:32-93","src/client/shell.css.ts:43-239","package.json:43-52"]}
